{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ConflictBehavior = \"warn\" | \"error\" | \"replace\" | \"allow\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L269","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:269"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Behavior when registering a hotkey/sequence that conflicts with an existing registration."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'warn'"},{"type":"text","value":" - Log a warning to the console but allow both registrations (default)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'error'"},{"type":"text","value":" - Throw an error and prevent the new registration"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'replace'"},{"type":"text","value":" - Unregister the existing registration and register the new one"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'allow'"},{"type":"text","value":" - Allow multiple registrations without warning"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ConflictBehavior = \"warn\" | \"error\" | \"replace\" | \"allow\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:269](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L269)\n\nBehavior when registering a hotkey/sequence that conflicts with an existing registration.\n\n- `'warn'` - Log a warning to the console but allow both registrations (default)\n- `'error'` - Throw an error and prevent the new registration\n- `'replace'` - Unregister the existing registration and register the new one\n- `'allow'` - Allow multiple registrations without warning\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ConflictBehavior\ntitle: ConflictBehavior\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ConflictBehavior = \"warn\" | \"error\" | \"replace\" | \"allow\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:269](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L269)\n\nBehavior when registering a hotkey/sequence that conflicts with an existing registration.\n\n- `'warn'` - Log a warning to the console but allow both registrations (default)\n- `'error'` - Throw an error and prevent the new registration\n- `'replace'` - Unregister the existing registration and register the new one\n- `'allow'` - Allow multiple registrations without warning\n"}
